    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is the CEO Systems Method™ right for me?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes — if you're a business owner who feels like your business runs on chaos, effort, and guesswork, this was built for you. It doesn't matter what industry you're in, whether you have a team or not, or how long you've been running your business. The 4 systems work for any business at any stage. The earlier you build them, the easier everything becomes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How long does the course take to complete?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">It's designed as a 30-day program at 15–30 minutes per day. But because it's self-paced with lifetime access, you can move faster or slower depending on your schedule. Some people complete it in 2 weeks. Others take 6 weeks and go deeper.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do I need the course before applying for mentorship?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Not required — but highly recommended. The course gives you the foundation and vocabulary that makes our mentorship sessions far more productive. Many mentorship clients come in as course graduates, which means we skip the basics and go straight into personalized strategy.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What kind of businesses is this for?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Any business owner who wants to stop running their business on effort and guesswork — and start running it on systems. Whether you're a freelancer, coach, consultant, retailer, or any kind of entrepreneur with a team or without. The frameworks work at any stage and for any business type. The systems just look slightly different depending on where you are.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do I apply for mentorship?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Click the apply button on your preferred mentorship package. You'll be directed to book a discovery call or fill out a short application. Cat personally reviews every application to make sure it's the right fit for both sides.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is there a refund policy on the course?</div>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes — there's a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you go through the material and feel it wasn't worth your investment, reach out and we'll make it right. No complicated process.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

